    "alt_2": {
      "type": "alternating-content",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Harvest.jpg",
        "heading": "",
        "body": "<p>Organic farming excludes synthetic fertilisers, pesticides, fungicides and growth hormones. Instead, we focus on building soil health through composting, mulching, and careful cultivation - creating a living system that supports the vine naturally.</p><p>This was not a dramatic shift, but a natural progression from low-intervention farming. The goal has always been the same: to grow better fruit by working in balance with the environment.</p>",
