      "name": "Alternating Content",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/FE_GRAPES_1.jpg",
        "heading": "",
        "body": "<p>The results are clear in the vineyard and the glass. Healthier soils produce more resilient vines, better able to adapt to seasonal variation. This leads to improved balance between canopy and crop, and ultimately, more expressive fruit. With steadier sugar and acid levels, grapes can remain on the vine longer, developing greater depth of flavour while retaining freshness and energy.</p><p>Better fruit allows us to take a lighter touch in the winery - capturing purity, texture and site expression in every wine.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
